      "id": "claim_adced1d5c82f4ee68ce268d03fbc22de",
      "statement": "Coverage A and Coverage B respond to direct physical loss to the described property, while Coverage C responds only to listed perils, so personal-property coverage fails at a narrower peril gate than dwelling and other-structures coverage.",
